@*
    The login split-card's dark brand panel.

    One copy, rendered by both Login/Index.cshtml and
    Login/ChangePassword.cshtml -- the two screens are the same flow and
    had identical panel markup, so the restyle (change request
    2026-10-29) lives here rather than being pasted into both.

    The GRAC logo is the real asset, in the place the design marked
    "Existing GRAC logo stays here". Everything below it is new.

    Colours come from grac-tokens.css, not from the design's literal hex
    values: --grac-navy-deep (#0C1129 vs the mock's #0E1326) and
    --grac-gold (#E8A33D vs #E2A43F) are the same two brand colours to
    the eye, and this panel is exactly the brand-only surface the token's
    own comment reserves the gold for. The SVG keeps its literal values
    where a token would be wrong: the node fills and strokes are panel
    furniture, not design-system surfaces.
*@
<div class="brand-panel">
    <div class="brand-inner">
        <div class="brand-logo">
            <img src="~/css/Images/Logo.png" alt="GRAC Logo" loading="lazy" />
        </div>

        <h1 class="brand-title">Compliance that runs<br />as <span>practice</span>, not paperwork.</h1>
        <p class="brand-lead">Every requirement, owned, operated and evidenced.</p>

        @* Decorative: the requirement -> practice -> obligations -> evidence
           flow, with the gap loop back to Task / Exception / Risk. Hidden
           from assistive technology -- the sentence above already says it. *@
        <div class="brand-art" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 480 170" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="presentation">
                <defs>
                    <linearGradient id="gracGold" x1="0" x2="1">
                        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#F0B54A" />
                        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#C9822B" />
                    </linearGradient>
                    <marker id="gracAr" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto">
                        <path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="#4B5578" />
                    </marker>
                    <marker id="gracArG" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto">
                        <path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="#E8A33D" />
                    </marker>
                </defs>

                <g stroke="#4B5578" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#gracAr)">
                    <line x1="96" y1="52" x2="128" y2="52" />
                    <line x1="216" y1="52" x2="248" y2="52" />
                    <line x1="336" y1="52" x2="368" y2="52" />
                </g>

                <g font-size="12" text-anchor="middle">
                    <rect x="8" y="24" width="88" height="56" rx="10" fill="#161D36" stroke="#2A3354" />
                    <text x="52" y="49" fill="#fff" font-weight="700">Requirement</text>
                    <text x="52" y="66" fill="#7E88A6" font-size="10.5">Source statement</text>

                    <rect x="128" y="24" width="88" height="56" rx="10" fill="#161D36" stroke="#2A3354" />
                    <text x="172" y="49" fill="#fff" font-weight="700">Practice</text>
                    <text x="172" y="66" fill="#7E88A6" font-size="10.5">Owned &amp; scoped</text>

                    <rect x="248" y="24" width="88" height="56" rx="10" fill="#161D36" stroke="#2A3354" />
                    <text x="292" y="49" fill="#fff" font-weight="700">Obligations</text>
                    <text x="292" y="66" fill="#7E88A6" font-size="10.5">Operationalized</text>

                    <rect x="368" y="24" width="104" height="56" rx="10" fill="url(#gracGold)" />
                    <text x="420" y="49" fill="#0C1129" font-weight="900">Evidence</text>
                    <text x="420" y="66" fill="#3A2A10" font-size="10.5">Audit-ready</text>
                </g>

                <path d="M292 80 V122 H232" stroke="#E8A33D" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" fill="none" marker-end="url(#gracArG)" />
                <rect x="132" y="106" width="98" height="32" rx="16" fill="rgba(232,163,61,.12)" stroke="#E8A33D" />
                <text x="181" y="126" fill="#E8A33D" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">Gap detected</text>
                <path d="M132 122 H60 V84" stroke="#E8A33D" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" fill="none" marker-end="url(#gracArG)" />
                <text x="64" y="152" fill="#7E88A6" font-size="10.5">Task &#183; Exception &#183; Risk</text>
            </svg>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
